Entry Requirements:
(i) A Bachelors Degree in Pharmacy with minimum CGPA of 2.75, as accepted by the HEP Senate;
OR
(ii) A Bachelors Degree in Pharmacy not meeting CGPA of 2.75 but above CGPA of 2.50, can be accepted subject to rigorous internal assessment;
OR
(iii) A Bachelors Degree in Pharmacy not meeting CGPA of 2.50, can be accepted subject to a minimum ten years working experience in relevant field

Entry Requirements:
(i) A Bachelors Degree in Computing field with minimum 2.75 CGPA;
OR
(ii) A Bachelors Degree in Computing field with CGPA below 2.75 but above 2.5 may be accepted, subject to rigorous internal review process;
OR
(iii) Other equivalent qualification recognised by Malaysian Government
